    "raw": "Scattered knowledge makes up the entire base of what we know about the race we refer to as the Precursors. Largely because we have no way to know what they called themselves. No text ever speaks of their species identification. Nothing ever mentions a homeworld, star, system...if they were xenophobes they were exceptionally protective and paranoid ones.",
    "value": "零散的知识构成了我们对“先驱”这一种族认知的全部基础，之所以如此称呼，很大程度上是因为我们根本无从得知他们如何自称。没有任何文献提及他们的种族称谓，也没有任何记载提到他们的母星、恒星或星系...如果说他们并非排外者，那他们至少也是异常戒备、极度偏执的一族。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Fortunately, most scholars aren't me. I came across a ruin...I'll keep the location secret for now. Sasha...you won't believe it! A library. A massive, well-preserved and fully functioning library. The information within is, without a doubt, the most significant archaeological find in the history of the entire cosmos. All I need to do is make it to the meeting on Earth and I can present my findings after the Protectorate emergency summit.",
    "value": "所幸，我与大多数学者不同。我偶然发现了一处遗迹...具体位置我暂且保密。萨莎...你绝对无法相信！是一座图书馆，一座庞大、保存完好、功能完备的图书馆。其中的信息毫无疑问是整个宇宙历史上最具重大意义的考古发现。现在我只须赶赴地球参加会议，就能在大地保护团紧急峰会之后正式公布我的发现。"
